      "message": "Note - on the corsola project, this GPIO `gpio_usb_c0_tcpc_rst` is active high.  This means that herobrine and corsola are currently using opposite logic:\n\nHerobrine:\n```\n\t\tif (gpio_pin_get_dt(\n\t\t\t    GPIO_DT_FROM_NODELABEL(gpio_usb_c0_pd_rst_l)))\n\t\t\tstatus |\u003d PD_STATUS_TCPC_ALERT_0;\n```\n\nThis is further confirmation that the active high/active low status needs to be fixed on each project before moving this code into the shim driver.",
